09425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your loyal German Shepherd to assist in search-and-rescue missions and send him out to sniff out explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.poster.avif?t=1757409425\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.webm?t=1757409425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/4750130218a8dd4a0edc243168639b65.mp4?t=1757409425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to run large-scale logistics operations and play the captivating story together!</p>","developers":["Nano Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/3c88fb4e16f552d1f70cd2585198f4901009100a/header.jpg?t=1757409425","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154809,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154809/movie480.mp4?t=1749645449","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154809/movie_max.mp4?t=1749645449"},"name":"NextFest Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154809/58a986782d1bc2968efecfcdb140b356430f88fb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749645449","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154809/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749645449","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers